                                        "entry_id": "d7e849fa-f6a6-3d25-80d5-0347efab3e4a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The state, quality, or condition of being standoffish or aloof and unsociable; aloofness."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cd37218a-3f20-428b-a46d-fa70895799ca",
                                                "sense_id": "d18bc297-abe5-3701-910b-ea6e22925f6b",
                                                "text": "Many of the seemingly bizarre courtship practices of English males—the cautiousness, reserve and apparent stand-offishness that foreign females complain about—are characteristic features of ‘negative politeness’."
